<title>USA: Jack Carl-312 Futures Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Jack Carl-312 Futures Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jack Carl-312 Futures Inc said Thursday it had net income of $265,400, or less than $0.01 per share, for its fiscal first quarter ended September 30.</p>
<p>It said this compares to a year-ago loss of $54,700, or less than $0.01 per share.</p>
<p>The company makes a market in interbank foreign exchange currencies for primarily non-private customers.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
